#
#   value_parsing_9 - parsing CSS values: <basic-shape>, CSS-wide keywords, <custom-ident>,
#                     <random-value-sharing> and <dashed-ident>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/ValueParsing.cpp (lines 3942-4417): the basic shapes
#       (inset(), xywh(), rect(), circle(), ellipse(), polygon(), path()), the CSS-wide keywords,
#       <custom-ident>, <random-value-sharing> and <dashed-ident>, with their style-value forms.
